        "Body": {
          "ContentType": "html",
          "Content": "<div><div><p><span><span>In</span><span><span>&nbsp;</span>November</span><span><span>&nbsp;</span>2025,<span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><span><span>the following updates and enhancements were made to Azure SQL:</span></span><span>&nbsp;</span></p></div><ul><li><p><span><span>V</span><span>iew</span><span>,<span>&nbsp;</span></span><span>modify</span><span>, insert rows in a table without manually writing T-SQL code<span>&nbsp;</span></span><span>using<span>&nbsp;</span></span><span>the interactive<span>&nbsp;</span></span><span>Edit Data<span>&nbsp;</span></span><span>interface</span><span><span>&nbsp;</span></span><span>in the MSSQL extension<span>&nbsp;</span></span><span>for Visual Studio<span>&nbsp;</span></span><span>Code</span><span>.</span><span><span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><a href=\"https://aka.ms/vscode-mssql-november2025\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span><span>Learn more</span></span></a><span><span>.</span></span><span>&nbsp;</span></p></li><li><p><span><span><span>Import and export DACPACs—now </span><span>available in the MSSQL extension</span><span>. </span><span>Apply DACPAC files to </span><span>new or existing databases or generate new files from existing databases. </span></span><a href=\"https://aka.ms/vscode-mssql-november2025\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span><span>Learn more</span></span></a><span><span>.</span></span><span>&nbsp;</span><br></span></p></li></ul><br></div>",
          "Markdown": "In November 2025, the following updates and enhancements were made to Azure SQL:\n\nV iew , modify , insert rows in a table without manually writing T-SQL code using the interactive Edit Data interface in the MSSQL extension for Visual Studio Code . Learn more .\n\nImport and export DACPACs—now available in the MSSQL extension . Apply DACPAC files to new or existing databases or generate new files from existing databases. Learn more ."
        },
